  "description": "OEDRO floor mats provide an excellent rugged and durable grip that will not slip; Can be conveniently wiped down to not accumulate stains.\nFeatures\nBuilt to Last: OEDRO floor mats are made from durable, high-quality rubber, offering superior longevity compared to other mats. The flexible, heavy-duty material resists wear and tear, even under constant use and friction from shoes.\nStylish & Classy Look: Upgrade your car’s interior with OEDRO all-weather floor mats. Their sleek, modern design enhances the look of your vehicle, adding a touch of color and sophistication that blends seamlessly with any interior.\nComprehensive Interior Protection: Protect your car’s interior with OEDRO floor mats, designed to keep your carpet clean and dry. These mats provide full coverage, preventing dirt, spills, and moisture from damaging your vehicle’s flooring.\nEasy to Clean & Maintain: Cleaning OEDRO mats is a breeze. Simply wipe away spills or rinse with soap and water. Once dry, there’s no lingering odor, leaving your car fresh and spotless.\nTraps Dirt & Moisture: OEDRO’s waterproof floor mats effectively trap dirt, dust, sand, and spills, keeping your car’s interior clean and dry. The deep channels and durable surface keep moisture and debris from spreading, ensuring your car stays pristine.\n2 years warranty. For your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2020-2025 Kia Telluride\nWith 2nd Bucket Seats\nWithout Center Console.\nFits for 7 Seats and 8 Seats Models",
